客户端架构模式决定了应用的可维护性、可测试性和扩展性。MVVM 是 XAML 平台的主流架构模式。

## MVVM 模式详解

**Model**：业务数据和逻辑
```csharp
public class User
{
    public int Id { get; set; }
    public string Name { get; set; }
    public string Email { get; set; }
}

public interface IUserRepository
{
    Task<User> GetByIdAsync(int id);
    Task<IEnumerable<User>> GetAllAsync();
    Task SaveAsync(User user);
}
```

**View**：UI 界面
```xml
<Window x:Class="MyApp.MainWindow">
    <StackPanel>
        <TextBox Text="{Binding UserName, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}" />
        <Button Content="保存" Command="{Binding SaveCommand}" />
        <TextBlock Text="{Binding StatusMessage}" />
    </StackPanel>
</Window>
```

**ViewModel**：视图逻辑和状态
```csharp
public class MainViewModel : ObservableObject
{
    private readonly IUserRepository _repository;

    public MainViewModel(IUserRepository repository)
    {
        _repository = repository;
        SaveCommand = new AsyncRelayCommand(SaveAsync);
    }

    [ObservableProperty]
    private string _userName;

    [ObservableProperty]
    private string _statusMessage;

    public IAsyncRelayCommand SaveCommand { get; }

    private async Task SaveAsync()
    {
        var user = new User { Name = UserName };
        await _repository.SaveAsync(user);
        StatusMessage = "保存成功";
    }
}
```

## MVVM Toolkit

CommunityToolkit.Mvvm 是微软官方的 MVVM 工具包：

**ObservableObject**：
```csharp
public partial class ViewModel : ObservableObject
{
    [ObservableProperty]
    private string _name;

    [ObservableProperty]
    [NotifyPropertyChangedFor(nameof(FullName))]
    private string _firstName;

    [ObservableProperty]
    [NotifyPropertyChangedFor(nameof(FullName))]
    private string _lastName;

    public string FullName => $"{FirstName} {LastName}";
}
```

**RelayCommand**：
```csharp
public partial class ViewModel : ObservableObject
{
    [RelayCommand]
    private void Save()
    {
        // 保存逻辑
    }

    [RelayCommand(CanExecute = nameof(CanDelete))]
    private void Delete()
    {
        // 删除逻辑
    }

    private bool CanDelete() => SelectedItem != null;

    [RelayCommand]
    private async Task LoadAsync()
    {
        // 异步加载
    }
}
```

**IRecipient 和消息传递**：
```csharp
public partial class ViewModel : ObservableObject, IRecipient<UserUpdatedMessage>
{
    public void Receive(UserUpdatedMessage message)
    {
        // 处理消息
    }
}

// 发送消息
WeakReferenceMessenger.Default.Send(new UserUpdatedMessage());
```

## ReactiveUI

ReactiveUI 是基于响应式编程的 MVVM 框架：

**ReactiveObject**：
```csharp
public class ViewModel : ReactiveObject
{
    private string _name;
    public string Name
    {
        get => _name;
        set => this.RaiseAndSetIfChanged(ref _name, value);
    }

    public ViewModel()
    {
        // 响应式属性
        this.WhenAnyValue(x => x.Name)
            .Where(name => !string.IsNullOrEmpty(name))
            .Subscribe(name =>
            {
                // 响应变化
            });

        // 响应式命令
        SaveCommand = ReactiveCommand.CreateFromTask(SaveAsync);
    }

    public ReactiveCommand<Unit, Unit> SaveCommand { get; }

    private async Task SaveAsync()
    {
        // 保存逻辑
    }
}
```

**ReactiveUI 的优势**：
1. 响应式编程模型
2. 强大的操作符（Where、Select、Merge 等）
3. 自动线程调度
4. 更好的异步处理

## 架构比较

**MVVM Toolkit 优势**：
- 微软官方支持
- 学习曲线低
- 源生成器简化代码
- 社区活跃

**ReactiveUI 优势**：
- 响应式编程强大
- 更灵活的组合
- 更好的异步处理
- 跨平台支持好

## 依赖注入集成

```csharp
// 配置服务
public static class ServiceCollectionExtensions
{
    public static IServiceCollection AddViewModels(this IServiceCollection services)
    {
        services.AddTransient<MainViewModel>();
        services.AddTransient<DetailViewModel>();
        return services;
    }
}

// 使用
public partial class MainWindow : Window
{
    public MainWindow(MainViewModel viewModel)
    {
        InitializeComponent();
        DataContext = viewModel;
    }
}
```

## 导航服务

```csharp
public interface INavigationService
{
    Task NavigateToAsync<TViewModel>() where TViewModel : class;
    Task NavigateToAsync<TViewModel>(object parameter) where TViewModel : class;
    Task GoBackAsync();
}

public class NavigationService : INavigationService
{
    private readonly IServiceProvider _serviceProvider;
    private readonly Stack<object> _navigationStack = new();

    public async Task NavigateToAsync<TViewModel>() where TViewModel : class
    {
        var viewModel = _serviceProvider.GetRequiredService<TViewModel>();
        _navigationStack.Push(viewModel);
        // 更新当前视图
    }
}
```

## 对话框服务

```csharp
public interface IDialogService
{
    Task<bool> ShowConfirmationAsync(string title, string message);
    Task<string> ShowInputAsync(string title, string message);
}

public class DialogService : IDialogService
{
    public async Task<bool> ShowConfirmationAsync(string title, string message)
    {
        // 显示确认对话框
        return true;
    }
}
```

## 测试 ViewModel

```csharp
[TestClass]
public class MainViewModelTests
{
    [TestMethod]
    public async Task Save_ValidData_SavesSuccessfully()
    {
        // Arrange
        var repository = new Mock<IUserRepository>();
        var viewModel = new MainViewModel(repository.Object);
        viewModel.UserName = "Test";

        // Act
        await viewModel.SaveCommand.ExecuteAsync(null);

        // Assert
        Assert.AreEqual("保存成功", viewModel.StatusMessage);
        repository.Verify(r => r.SaveAsync(It.IsAny<User>()), Times.Once);
    }
}
```

## 最佳实践

1. **ViewModel 不引用 View**：通过数据绑定通信
2. **使用依赖注入**：管理服务和 ViewModel 生命周期
3. **服务抽象**：通过接口隔离平台相关逻辑
4. **消息传递**：使用消息总线解耦 ViewModel
5. **单元测试**：ViewModel 应该可独立测试

## 取舍与误用
MVVM 最大的价值是 ViewModel 不依赖 View、可单元测试，且数据绑定省掉手写胶水代码。但容易被误用：① 简单界面（一个按钮一个标签）也套 MVVM，要写 ViewModel、属性、INotifyPropertyChanged、Command 一堆样板，反而比直接在 code-behind 写两行复杂，是过度设计；② 数据绑定调试难——绑定路径写错通常不报错、只是界面不更新，要看 binding error 输出；③ ViewModel 容易膨胀成上帝类，复杂逻辑要进一步拆 Service。所以 MVVM 是中大型、需要可测试、绑定丰富场景的利器，不是所有界面的银弹；绑定弱的平台（WinForms、老 Android）用 MVP 更合适。

using System;
using System.Collections.ObjectModel;
using System.Reactive;
using System.Reactive.Linq;
using System.Threading.Tasks;
using System.Windows.Input;
using CommunityToolkit.Mvvm.ComponentModel;
using CommunityToolkit.Mvvm.Input;
using CommunityToolkit.Mvvm.Messaging;
using ReactiveUI;

namespace ClientArchitectureDemo
{
    // Model
    public class Product
    {
        public int Id { get; set; }
        public string Name { get; set; }
        public decimal Price { get; set; }
        public int Stock { get; set; }
    }

    // Repository
    public interface IProductRepository
    {
        Task<IEnumerable<Product>> GetAllAsync();
        Task<Product> GetByIdAsync(int id);
        Task SaveAsync(Product product);
        Task DeleteAsync(int id);
    }

    // Messages
    public record ProductUpdatedMessage(int ProductId);
    public record ProductDeletedMessage(int ProductId);

    // MVVM Toolkit ViewModel
    public partial class ProductListViewModel : ObservableObject, IRecipient<ProductUpdatedMessage>, IRecipient<ProductDeletedMessage>
    {
        private readonly IProductRepository _repository;
        private readonly INavigationService _navigationService;

        public ProductListViewModel(
            IProductRepository repository,
            INavigationService navigationService)
        {
            _repository = repository;
            _navigationService = navigationService;

            Products = new ObservableCollection<Product>();

            // 注册消息
            WeakReferenceMessenger.Default.Register<ProductUpdatedMessage>(this);
            WeakReferenceMessenger.Default.Register<ProductDeletedMessage>(this);
        }

        public ObservableCollection<Product> Products { get; }

        [ObservableProperty]
        private Product _selectedProduct;

        [ObservableProperty]
        private bool _isBusy;

        [ObservableProperty]
        private string _searchText;

        [RelayCommand]
        private async Task LoadAsync()
        {
            if (IsBusy) return;

            IsBusy = true;
            try
            {
                var products = await _repository.GetAllAsync();
                Products.Clear();
                foreach (var product in products)
                {
                    Products.Add(product);
                }
            }
            finally
            {
                IsBusy = false;
            }
        }

        [RelayCommand]
        private async Task AddAsync()
        {
            await _navigationService.NavigateToAsync<ProductDetailViewModel>();
        }

        [RelayCommand(CanExecute = nameof(CanEditDelete))]
        private async Task EditAsync()
        {
            if (SelectedProduct != null)
            {
                await _navigationService.NavigateToAsync<ProductDetailViewModel>(SelectedProduct.Id);
            }
        }

        [RelayCommand(CanExecute = nameof(CanEditDelete))]
        private async Task DeleteAsync()
        {
            if (SelectedProduct != null)
            {
                await _repository.DeleteAsync(SelectedProduct.Id);
                Products.Remove(SelectedProduct);
                WeakReferenceMessenger.Default.Send(new ProductDeletedMessage(SelectedProduct.Id));
            }
        }

        private bool CanEditDelete() => SelectedProduct != null;

        public void Receive(ProductUpdatedMessage message)
        {
            // 刷新列表
            LoadCommand.Execute(null);
        }

        public void Receive(ProductDeletedMessage message)
        {
            // 刷新列表
            LoadCommand.Execute(null);
        }
    }

    // ReactiveUI ViewModel
    public class ProductDetailReactiveViewModel : ReactiveObject
    {
        private readonly IProductRepository _repository;

        private string _name;
        public string Name
        {
            get => _name;
            set => this.RaiseAndSetIfChanged(ref _name, value);
        }

        private decimal _price;
        public decimal Price
        {
            get => _price;
            set => this.RaiseAndSetIfChanged(ref _price, value);
        }

        private int _stock;
        public int Stock
        {
            get => _stock;
            set => this.RaiseAndSetIfChanged(ref _stock, value);
        }

        private bool _isBusy;
        public bool IsBusy
        {
            get => _isBusy;
            set => this.RaiseAndSetIfChanged(ref _isBusy, value);
        }

        public ReactiveCommand<Unit, Unit> SaveCommand { get; }
        public ReactiveCommand<Unit, Unit> CancelCommand { get; }

        public ProductDetailReactiveViewModel(IProductRepository repository)
        {
            _repository = repository;

            // 验证
            var canSave = this.WhenAnyValue(
                x => x.Name,
                x => x.Price,
                (name, price) => !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(name) && price > 0);

            SaveCommand = ReactiveCommand.CreateFromTask(SaveAsync, canSave);
            CancelCommand = ReactiveCommand.Create(() => { });

            // 响应式属性
            this.WhenAnyValue(x => x.Name)
                .Where(name => name?.Length > 50)
                .Subscribe(name => Name = name[..50]);
        }

        private async Task SaveAsync()
        {
            IsBusy = true;
            try
            {
                var product = new Product
                {
                    Name = Name,
                    Price = Price,
                    Stock = Stock
                };
                await _repository.SaveAsync(product);
                WeakReferenceMessenger.Default.Send(new ProductUpdatedMessage(product.Id));
            }
            finally
            {
                IsBusy = false;
            }
        }
    }

    // Services
    public interface INavigationService
    {
        Task NavigateToAsync<TViewModel>() where TViewModel : class;
        Task NavigateToAsync<TViewModel>(object parameter) where TViewModel : class;
        Task GoBackAsync();
    }

    public interface IDialogService
    {
        Task<bool> ShowConfirmationAsync(string title, string message);
        Task ShowMessageAsync(string title, string message);
    }

    // 共享 ViewModel 基类
    public abstract class ViewModelBase : ObservableObject
    {
        protected readonly INavigationService NavigationService;
        protected readonly IDialogService DialogService;

        protected ViewModelBase(INavigationService navigationService, IDialogService dialogService)
        {
            NavigationService = navigationService;
            DialogService = dialogService;
        }

        [ObservableProperty]
        private string _title;

        [ObservableProperty]
        private bool _isBusy;

        [ObservableProperty]
        private string _errorMessage;

        protected async Task ExecuteAsync(Func<Task> action, string errorMessage = null)
        {
            if (IsBusy) return;

            IsBusy = true;
            ErrorMessage = null;

            try
            {
                await action();
            }
            catch (Exception ex)
            {
                ErrorMessage = errorMessage ?? ex.Message;
                await DialogService.ShowMessageAsync("错误", ErrorMessage);
            }
            finally
            {
                IsBusy = false;
            }
        }
    }

    // 依赖注入配置
    public static class ServiceCollectionExtensions
    {
        public static IServiceCollection AddClientServices(this IServiceCollection services)
        {
            services.AddSingleton<INavigationService, NavigationService>();
            services.AddSingleton<IDialogService, DialogService>();
            services.AddSingleton<IProductRepository, ProductRepository>();

            services.AddTransient<ProductListViewModel>();
            services.AddTransient<ProductDetailReactiveViewModel>();

            return services;
        }
    }

    // 导航服务实现
    public class NavigationService : INavigationService
    {
        private readonly IServiceProvider _serviceProvider;
        private readonly Stack<object> _navigationStack = new();

        public NavigationService(IServiceProvider serviceProvider)
        {
            _serviceProvider = serviceProvider;
        }

        public Task NavigateToAsync<TViewModel>() where TViewModel : class
        {
            var viewModel = _serviceProvider.GetRequiredService<TViewModel>();
            _navigationStack.Push(viewModel);
            // 实际应用中需要更新当前视图
            return Task.CompletedTask;
        }

        public Task NavigateToAsync<TViewModel>(object parameter) where TViewModel : class
        {
            var viewModel = _serviceProvider.GetRequiredService<TViewModel>();
            // 传递参数
            _navigationStack.Push(viewModel);
            return Task.CompletedTask;
        }

        public Task GoBackAsync()
        {
            if (_navigationStack.Count > 1)
            {
                _navigationStack.Pop();
                var previous = _navigationStack.Peek();
                // 更新当前视图
            }
            return Task.CompletedTask;
        }
    }
}
